<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 7.2 bln levs 1-wk discount T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 7.2 bln levs 1-wk discount T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed 7.22 billion levs worth of one-week discount T-bills, yielding 3.15 percent until maturity, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the BNB did not say with which financial institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Prices are in percent of par:</p>
<p> Issue number		     BG 3021796001</p>
<p> Par value			  7,220 million levs</p>
<p> Issue date			 December 11, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity date		    December 18, 1996</p>
<p> Avrrage selling price	  96.95 pct</p>
<p> Average yield to maturity    3.15 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
